  "title": "小杨的幸运数",
  "tags": [
    "筛法",
    "二分查找"
  ],
  "description": "不小于 a 的完全平方数及其正整数倍都算幸运数。对每个 x 判断是否幸运；若不是，找到大于 x 的最近幸运数。",
  "input": "第一行 a、N，接下来 N 行各有一个 x。",
  "output": "幸运数输出 lucky；否则输出向上调整后的幸运数。",
  "constraints": "a ≤ 10^6；N ≤ 2×10^5；1 ≤ x ≤ 1000001。",
  "sampleInput": "4 4\n1\n4\n5\n9\n",
  "sampleOutput": "4\nlucky\n8\nlucky\n",
  "sampleLabel": "自编示例",
  "cases": [
    {
      "input": "4 4\n1\n4\n5\n9\n",
      "expected": "4\nlucky\n8\nlucky\n",
      "score": 33
    },
    {
      "input": "1 2\n1\n10\n",
      "expected": "lucky\nlucky\n",
      "score": 33
    },
    {
      "input": "10 2\n11\n25\n",
      "expected": "16\nlucky\n",
      "score": 34
    }
  ],
